{
  "public_post": "Dear villagers, I must inform you that the flour batch used for this week's bread is contaminated; all loaves this week are unsafe. Effective immediately, the co‑op will cease bread sales for the rest of the week and refund any purchases made. I am arranging a safe flour supply for next week and will update you as soon as fresh bread is available. Your health comes first.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers from illness by halting sales of contaminated bread."
}
